sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Store as Store / Production Manager
    actor Worker as Job Worker (Vendor)
    participant Indent as JW Indent
    participant JWO as Job Work Order
    participant Challan as JW Delivery Challan
    participant Inv as Inventory Ledger
    participant Gate as Gate Receipt & QC
    participant Ledger as Worker Stock Ledger
    participant Adj as Loss & Scrap Adjustments

    Store->>Indent: Raise Job Work Indent (Required operations & output)
    Store->>JWO: Convert Approved Indent to Job Work Order (Rate Contract applied)
    Store->>Challan: Issue Delivery Challan for Raw Materials
    Challan->>Inv: Append INVENTORY_TRANSACTION (Type: Material Send for Job work)
    Challan->>Ledger: Append Ledger Entry (DEBIT worker balance: +Qty)
    Store->>Worker: Dispatch Material with physical Challan
    Worker-->>Gate: Return Processed Parts & Scrap
    Gate->>Gate: Create Job Work Receipt + Quality Inspection (Accepted/Rejected/Scrap)
    Gate->>Inv: Append INVENTORY_TRANSACTION (FG / SFG Material Inward)
    Gate->>Ledger: Append Ledger Entry (CREDIT worker balance: -Consumed Qty)
    Store->>Adj: Record Permissible Process Loss & Scrap Disposal
    Adj->>Ledger: Adjust remaining worker ledger variance
